Package: modbus-schoolbell
Version: 5.1.28
Architecture: all
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Viacheslav Mezentsev
Depends: lua, luci-base, luci-theme-bootstrap, luci-lib-nixio, luci-lib-jsonc, uhttpd, uci, madplay, kmod-usb-audio, modbus-schoolbell-clock (= 1.0.0)
Description: Schoolbell schedules, named calendar plans, media library and LuCI UI.
 Engineering executor with explicit activation and clock trust control.
 Installation, upgrade and rollback leave automatic bells disabled.
